==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns as the boss.
